s"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncBroadcastSequence":{"title":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An async sequence that multicasts elements from an upstream sequence to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncbroadcastsequence"}}}